From: Yumi Yukimura <me.cafebabe@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 16:04:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] libchrome-gestures: Use `-O2` optimizations explicitly

Breaks with `-O3`.

Change-Id: I12a7bf9db0b6d4d66816e231da5a43658fffb1ad
---
 Android.bp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index d0d1251..acb6f4d 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -38,6 +38,7 @@ cc_defaults {
         "-D__STDC_FORMAT_MACROS=1",
         "-D_FILE_OFFSET_BITS=64",
         "-DGESTURES_INTERNAL=1",
+        "-O2",
     ],
     cpp_std: "c++20",
     sanitize: {
